    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, i've been feeling kinda weird lately. like, out of nowhere i'll just get super confused for a few mins... i can't find basic words i know, like i'll be mid sentence and just blank. it's scaring me a bit. do u think it's just brain fog from being stressed and not sleeping enough? i've been working a lot lately.",
