      "content": "While lifestyle changes can certainly help with general brain fog, self-treating significant cognitive slips without a diagnosis carries some risk. Before starting any supplements, it would be wise to focus heavily on improving sleep consistency and hydration, as these are foundational for brain health. If symptoms persist or worsen, even if they are brief, consulting a doctor remains the safest step to rule out any medical causes.",
